  "title": "Procurement Policy Note 02/20: supplier relief due to coronavirus (COVID-19)",
  "canonical_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/procurement-policy-note-0220-supplier-relief-due-to-covid-19",
  "description": "This Procurement Policy Note (PPN) [and guidance / documents] is now out of date",
